hw4|n|A solid body which may be generated by the rotation of a parallelogram round one its sides; or a body of rollerlike form, of which the longitudinal section is oblong, and the cross section is circular. ; The space inclosed by any cylindrical surface. The space may be limited or unlimited in length. ; Any hollow body of cylindrical form ; The chamber of a steam engine in which the piston is moved by the force of steam. ; The barrel of an air or other pump. ; The revolving platen or bed which produces the impression or carries the type in a cylinder press. ; The bore of a gun; the turning chambered breech of a revolver. ; The revolving square prism carrying the cards in a Jacquard loom.	a:22mb,84,2;z00,72,10;1win,47,11;168t,41,5;1xqa,33,3;ucq,28,3;1x8n,27,5;168q,25,3;17s8,11,2~1win,47,11;z00,72,10;1x8n,27,5;168t,41,5;168q,25,3;ucq,28,3;1xqa,33,3;22mb,84,2;17s8,11,2	n:z00,54,3;1sra,50,3;kag,40,7;21h4,12,2;1bf4,7,4~kag,40,7;1bf4,7,4;1sra,50,3;z00,54,3;21h4,12,2	N:1vra,42,4;kag,35,5;2a1j,26,2;1ek8,20,2~kag,35,5;1vra,42,4;2a1j,26,2;1ek8,20,2
